Date: Thu, 9 Feb 2023 15:13:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Use distribution wheels for RPM installations

Locate seed wheels provided by the interpreter or /usr/share/python-wheels.
Keep the RPM wheel search paths when invoking pip to download a seed.

Downstream-Origin: https://github.com/openRuyi-Project/openRuyi/blob/4a77554c97ed3cb8134b682c245646fde8810999/SPECS/python-virtualenv/2000-use-system-wheels.patch
